  "$comment": "Telemetry egress allowlist (SPEC-007 §4.3, §2.1, §3.1, §5.2, §5.3, §5.4; EP-008 M1). The classification of every emitted field is DATA, NOT A CODE COMMENT (§4.3): a field with no entry here is DENIED at runtime. Dispositions are a closed set: ALLOW (no privacy surface), ALLOW_WITH_REDACTION (permitted only with a tenant policy row, an entry here, and an unconditional deterministic redaction pass), DENY_BY_DEFAULT (permitted only with the tenant policy row of §4.3, which no environment in this repository has yet), DENY (no telemetry exception). Every canonical resource key carries the §2.1 fail-closed reason code as its on_resolution_failure value; a reader can count them with `grep -c` over this file and must get exactly nine, one per key.",
  "version": "1",
